Detector: reentrancy-events
Reentrancy in Token.approve(address,uint256) ():
	External calls:
	- controller.approve(msg.sender,_spender,_value) ()
	Event emitted after the call(s):
	- Approval(msg.sender,_spender,_value) ()
Reentrancy in Token.burn(uint256) ():
	External calls:
	- controller.burn(msg.sender,_amount) ()
	Event emitted after the call(s):
	- Transfer(msg.sender,0x0,_amount) ()
Reentrancy in Token.decreaseApproval(address,uint256) ():
	External calls:
	- controller.decreaseApproval(msg.sender,_spender,_subtractedValue) ()
	- newval = controller.allowance(msg.sender,_spender) ()
	Event emitted after the call(s):
	- Approval(msg.sender,_spender,newval) ()
Reentrancy in Token.increaseApproval(address,uint256) ():
	External calls:
	- controller.increaseApproval(msg.sender,_spender,_addedValue) ()
	- newval = controller.allowance(msg.sender,_spender) ()
	Event emitted after the call(s):
	- Approval(msg.sender,_spender,newval) ()
Reentrancy in Token.transfer(address,uint256) ():
	External calls:
	- controller.transfer(msg.sender,_to,_value) ()
	Event emitted after the call(s):
	- Transfer(msg.sender,_to,_value) ()
Reentrancy in Token.transferFrom(address,address,uint256) ():
	External calls:
	- controller.transferFrom(msg.sender,_from,_to,_value) ()
	Event emitted after the call(s):
	- Transfer(_from,_to,_value) ()
Reentrancy in Token.transferToInternalLedger(uint256,bytes32) ():
	External calls:
	- transfer(atFundDeposit,_value) ()
		- controller.transfer(msg.sender,_to,_value) ()
	Event emitted after the call(s):
	- TransferInternalLedgerAT(msg.sender,atFundDeposit,_value,_mdn) ()
Reference: https://github.com/crytic/slither/wiki/Detector-Documentation#reentrancy-vulnerabilities-4

